• Analysing regulatory frameworks, policy proposals, ince ntives, and complex data sets to draw clear conclusions and make practical recommendations . &nbsp;

• Build ing, owning and maintaining robust models to support regulatory and investment decisions. &nbsp;

• Producing clear, regulator-ready reports, consultation responses and regulatory submissions, as well as concise presentations for executive audiences. &nbsp;

• Managing defined workstreams, coordinating inputs, maintaining quality and supporting delivery to agreed timescales. &nbsp;

• Building trusted relationships with clients and senior stakeholders, contributing ideas and constructive challenges throughout engagements. &nbsp;

